Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:08.26,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,300,550,6800,7500)\pos(653.755,449.455)}Episode 76 \N\N\N\N\NThe Extinguishing of Shangfang Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:38.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,As Sima Yi held on to his position, refusing to engage with Zhuge Liang's forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.98,0:00:43.41,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang ordered his forces to spread and build camps for the long term.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.97,0:00:48.35,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At the same time, he ordered Ma Dai in secret to lay an ambush at Shangfang Valley,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:55.95,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and to build empty sheds while gathering firewoods and other inflammables in preparation for Sima Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:03.75,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.667,306.667)}Gāo Xiáng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.06,0:01:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, we've caught the Shu soldiers in charge of grain transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:19.17,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344,281.333)}Sīmǎ Yì\NStyled: Zhòngdá
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.30,0:01:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they sending the grain?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,To Shangfang Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Again to Shangfang Valley?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Zhuge Liang's grain store located there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.93,0:01:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All provisions are in the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Zhuge Liang now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.52,0:01:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They have camped ten{\i1} li{\i0} away from the Shangfang Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, prepare food and wine for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:58.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.333,486.667)}Sīmǎ Shī\NStyled: Zǐyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.56,0:01:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why do you spare them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will be gained by killing a few common soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Treat them well, let the Shu soldiers see our grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and they will have no will to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.56,0:02:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite right, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is storing grain in Shangfang Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows we will not fight him directly, so he intends to hold out for the long term.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I shall not let him achieve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.49,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, you will attack their camp at Mount Qi. \NI will lead a detachment personally to your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, why attack their rear position?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount Qi is their base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If we lay our assault there, they will certainly come to its rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment, I will lead a surprise attack on Shangfang Valley, and burn their supply depot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That will cut off their forces from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the Shu will be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the Shu soldiers have fallen to our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They will now run onto Mount Qi's rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me to Shangfang Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Wei forces are attacking our camp at Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi has fallen into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:44.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(348,502.667)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to Shangfang Valley at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:59.87,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.333,525.333)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, you dare to attack our depot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan, before I paid no heed to your challenges,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but today I shall teach you our might!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, there are no soldiers in the valley, only straw sheds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be Zhuge Liang's supply depot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Onwards to the Valley, take their grain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, there is no tall grass in the valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.85,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our position here is dangerous and compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If they were to close the mouth of the valley and use fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, but there is no woods or tall grass in the valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.83,0:05:50.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,430.667)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not take the enemy lightly, retreat at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.20,0:06:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi, your death is now certain. \NDo not fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.36,0:06:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the Shu soldiers are setting fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! The mouth of the valley \Nis blocked by the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Father! The mouth of the valley \Nis blocked by the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've fallen into Zhuge Liang's trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.40,0:07:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to meet our end here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, the fire keeps growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Search elsewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-We can't escape!\N-Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what do we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.08,0:08:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of our family!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.36,0:08:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's starting to rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens bear witness to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rain for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Its raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's raining! \N-Heavens bless us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.80,0:09:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We must break through now! Dash out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dash out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Onwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:31.55,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(489.333,408)}Wáng Píng\NStyled: Zǐjūn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:58.51,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,557.333)}Mǎ Dài
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu soldiers assaulted our camp at the south bank of Wei River during our attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang planned ahead of me once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Order our forces to burn the floating\Nbridge and fortify at the north bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:51.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(888,370)}Liào Huà \NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heavens sent rain to help us escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A true god-send!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell into a trap and lost our camp\Non the south bank of the Wei River!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What merriment is there!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your tents!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Zhuge Liang's camp at the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shu army is at the south bank of the Wei River.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're at Wuzhang Plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens bless us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}If Zhuge Liang were coming out from Wugong, and moving eastwards along the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}we would be in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Now he stations his army at Wuzhang Plain,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}the river acts as a barrier separating our camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Pass my orders, fortify and hold our positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Whoever proposes another\N battle will be put to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we've captured the Wei camp at south bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have won the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:16.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.333,484)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Sima Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He is encamped on the north bank of the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.08,0:12:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we've challenged\Nthe Wei forces time and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but they've refused to fight us. \NWhat can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go rest for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we cannot stall by the river for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to fight fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't wish to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi was fortunate to have escaped from Shangfang Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To provoke him to another battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.40,0:13:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go. Let me think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:07.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,It seems that I need to bring humiliation upon him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,incite him to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:18.07,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}...Though, Zhongda, you are the Chief Commander of the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:21.41,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}you dare not to have a fight like a true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:24.52,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Instead, you hold on to your nest to avoid battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:27.48,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}{\bord14\pos(640,663)}How do you differ from womenfolk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, what are you laughing at? Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.60,0:15:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has presented me with a woman's dress,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.24,0:15:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,to humiliate me for not having the courage to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang dares to mock you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Attendant, change my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Zhuge Liang bring me any message?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that if you don't wish to be humiliated,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,then you should meet with him on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, let us fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:16:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.60,0:16:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've accepted his thoughtful gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Guards.\N-Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a feast to treat our dear envoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Father-!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief-Clerk Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue, any news from the other side?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:37.01,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(589.333,461.333)}Yáng Yí\NStyled: Wēigōng
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.48,0:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Report to the Chancellor as\Nsoon as anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Chancellor and I have had quite a few trials of wits and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Each has his victories and setbacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In these trials, wonderful schemes\Nemerged one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A delight to us military commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.11,0:17:47.25,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(438.667,412)}Xiàhóu Bà \NStyled: Zhòngquán
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.17,0:17:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am barely his equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:18:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}How has your Chancellor ever managed his daily life with his work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Our Chancellor wakes early and works to late hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}He attends to all rulings and punishments in the army personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}He eats little during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.20,0:18:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Chancellor's age now must be four over fifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.07,0:18:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I do not know Chancellor's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.00,0:18:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}Your Chancellor, advanced in age, working long hours and eating little. How much longer can he live?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Any news?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your Chancellor to express my gratitude for his efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he can stay at ease, without any further worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, Zhuge Liang\Nhas gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are willing to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander, as the nation's senior officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,how can we stand for such an insult?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If Commander does not fight, then we will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, we are willing to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not for fear of battle that I stomach this humiliation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but I received His Majesty's direct edict to stand down and fortify.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go into battle, it would defy the Emperor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.80,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist on a battle, I shall petition His Majesty first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,then we may take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He inquired about your daily life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him that you work long hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,that you eat and rest little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi also said...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He said...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, Chancellor works long hours and eats little, so how much longer can Chancellor live?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.84,0:22:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}I, your servant, modest of merit yet held in high office,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.96,0:22:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}have fortified and stalled until Shu falls apart by itself, as Your Majesty has commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.48,0:22:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Yet now Zhuge Liang regards me as like womenfolk and brought me a woman's dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Thus I wish Your Majesty may grant me a chance to war, in gratitude for the court's grace
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,661)}and to avenge this insult upon our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Your servant will be deeply grateful if my wish can be taken by Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.80,0:22:50.85,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(380,310.667)}Cáo Ruì\NStyled: Yuánzhòng
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi is still holding onto his position.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he sending this petition?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:23:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Your Majesty, \NSima Yi has no desire to battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}His officers must have been enraged by Zhuge Liang's insult, thus the reason for the petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.42,0:23:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}He wishes to appease and pacify his officers with an edict from Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Sima, hear thy decree.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.60,0:23:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Any further request for battle will be taken as disobedience against Imperial edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.28,0:23:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir understands me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.20,0:24:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, the Lord of Wei sent Xin Pi as envoy to order Sima Yi not to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but Sima Yi's ploy to pacify his men,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.32,0:24:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as weaken our resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.12,0:24:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you must not\Noverwork yourself any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If matters go on this way, your health will be damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.37,0:25:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All men in the camp sincerely wish for you to look after yourself, for the sake of our nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.64,0:25:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor attends to all the matters personally to the point of exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.23,0:25:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish for Chancellor to take a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.76,0:25:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I need to live up to the trust placed in me by the late emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear no other-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.20,0:25:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,... No other man can be as devoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.48,0:25:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.50,0:25:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fei Yi has arrived from the capital Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.68,0:25:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it is urgent military matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Show him in at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.69,0:26:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.20,0:26:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Xun of Eastern Wu was defeated by Cao Rui, and has retreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:17.75,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(878.667,486.667)}Fèi Yī\NStyled: Wénwěi
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.20,0:26:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eastern Wu has withdrawn all troops back to Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They cannot join us to fight against Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.80,0:26:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.28,0:26:38.59,Thinking,,0,0,0,,With the withdrawal of the forces of Eastern Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:43.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the combined assault of Wu and Shu against Wei ends in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:47.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sima Yi kept holding on to his position,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.36,0:26:50.06,Thinking,,0,0,0,,preventing the Shu army's advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.80,0:26:53.32,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang's health broke down
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.40,0:26:58.07,Thinking,,0,0,0,,as a result of this news, combined with long and strenuous overwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.04,0:27:02.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(272,553.333)}Medic
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.44,0:27:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Medic, what is your diagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His pulse has slowed and his vitals are very weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He is very ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.76,0:27:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any treatments?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.71,0:28:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can collect medicinal herbs and prepare pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do so at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Medic, can this illness be kept away?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, no one can keep away an illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.18,0:28:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But Chancellor does not need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take a long rest, you may recover in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the fog in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My illness is a recurrent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.93,0:28:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I cannot heal from this illness now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.36,0:29:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor worries too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.48,0:29:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor needs to look after yourself. You're sure to make a recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.84,0:29:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't last long. Time is not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.28,0:29:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Boyue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.24,0:29:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.48,0:29:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eight Trigrams Formation I taught you... Have you practiced it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.24,0:29:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have practiced it, yet have not learned to grasp it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.64,0:30:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}This formation only appears like the {\i1}Bāguà,{\i0} yet can change into multitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.38,0:30:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The eight variations of its forms can add up to sixty-four in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.52,0:30:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The formation has eight gates, with corresponding colors of flags.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.72,0:30:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Each unit and flag are \Ndependent on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Life may turn out to be death and a closure may turn out to be an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,665)}You must remember them well.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor may rest assured. \NI will not let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In my spare time, I wrote down my art of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.92,0:31:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,with some chapters still to be finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.29,0:31:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When it is done,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.40,0:31:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall let you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.88,0:31:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I am forever grateful for Chancellor's grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.88,0:31:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens in the army tent should be kept absolutely secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The drills must continue as normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.84,0:31:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let Sima Yi learn of my illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.20,0:31:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Chancellor need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.58,0:33:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to see you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.92,0:33:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.29,0:33:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, how is your illness?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel slightly better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.32,0:33:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor must not overwork yourself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.64,0:33:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It is important to take good care of your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.36,0:33:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kind concern, Wenchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.24,0:33:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You look after all the matters\Nyourself, big and small.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.10,0:33:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You work mentally and physically, leading to this illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering the long-term,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.09,0:34:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,it is better for Chancellor to return to Hanzhong to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.86,0:34:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The matters of the camp can be taken care of by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.78,0:34:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've fought against with Sima Yi for many years as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know his tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.09,0:34:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor may return to Hanzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cross the Wei River and make a direct advance on Sima Yi's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.61,0:34:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I will march into Chang'an and onwards to Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.76,0:34:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, both your valor and heart are commendable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.38,0:34:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.37,0:34:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought for the late emperor for many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.90,0:34:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I follow you to battles north and south!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.83,0:34:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am tempered by the battlefield and well versed in the art of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.13,0:35:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot bear to see Chancellor suffer still from wind and frost, from arrow and sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I boldly ask for this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.53,0:35:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So that your long cherished wish can be fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.81,0:35:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For matters of such import, \NI have to submit a petition to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.66,0:35:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you a reply, after an approval is obtained. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.17,0:36:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has taken the\Nmedicine prepared by the doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.11,0:36:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but to little effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.40,0:36:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor has been concerned for the well-being of the people for so long…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.53,0:36:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but with his illness, what can we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.45,0:36:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a report to the Emperor, while he is still taking medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.34,0:36:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.14,0:36:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What do We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.20,0:36:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Father-Chancellor has worked so hard for Us and the nation, now he is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.81,0:36:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens to him, \Nhow can We keep ruling over the realm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.38,0:36:58.31,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.333,500)}Liú Shàn \NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.45,0:36:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You two! Do you have any ideas? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.24,0:37:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something, at least!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.38,0:37:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, the Chancellor's illness has been present for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This expedition of Mount Qi-
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.07,0:37:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.74,0:37:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do without him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.06,0:37:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The nation can't do without Father-Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.59,0:37:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Scribe Qiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.48,0:37:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you still read at a time like this!?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.22,0:37:29.81,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(954.667,464)}Qiáo Zhōu \NStyled: Yǔnnán
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.03,0:37:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I observed the stars last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.34,0:37:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The guest stars are bright \Nwhile the host stars are dim.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.64,0:37:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the books of astrology, the Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.61,0:37:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.57,0:37:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, We must have Father-Chancellor return to Chengdu!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We will look after him day and night personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.56,0:37:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Chancellor's illness, he cannot embark on such a rough journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.24,0:37:54.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.333,208)}Dǒng Yǔn \NStyled: Xiūzhāo
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.57,0:37:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.52,0:37:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do We do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.97,0:37:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do We do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.01,0:38:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do We do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.28,0:38:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.14,0:38:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My life may end at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.14,0:38:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, why do you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.51,0:38:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I observed the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.68,0:38:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}{\bord14\pos(640,663)}I saw that within the Sāntái-asterism,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.68,0:38:23.65,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Part of the Chinese constellation. Sāntái (三台)-asterism is part of \Nthe Supreme Palace Enclosure (太微垣), roughly corresponding to Ursa Major
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.48,0:38:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}the guest stars are brighter, while the host stars are dim.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.45,0:38:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}With such a celestial phenomenon,\NI know what is going to happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.59,0:38:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}The stars may say such,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.40,0:38:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}but the Chancellor can make a ritual prayer and reverse the fate of the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.01,0:38:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Even if I were to make a prayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}what would the will of heaven decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.96,0:38:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}The heavens will witness you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.52,0:38:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.10,0:39:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14\pos(640,663)}Tomorrow, please pray for the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14)} Chancellor, please begin \Nthe ritual for the stars soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.16,0:39:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord14}A nation cannot be without its chancellor, \Nnor can an army be without its commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.18,0:39:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.62,0:39:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please tell me what preparations I should make for the ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.90,0:39:36.73,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Striving to the utmost, \Nunto one's dying day."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.33,0:39:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Have forty-nine armored men prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.14,0:39:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them dress in dark clothes and hold black banners, to form a circle outside my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.04,0:39:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.22,0:40:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, shut the entrance of my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.74,0:40:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep all other people outside my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Only let a few page-boys bring me the necessary tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.91,0:40:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all, you may go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.61,0:40:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,

